    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/tarball/v1.7.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/zipball/v1.7.0",
    "body": "### 🚀 What's New in v1.7.0\n\nThis release completely re-imagines the **📡 Nix Channels Manager** with smart UX:\n\n#### 1. ⚡ Curated Channels Presets Dropdown\n- No need to memorize or type long URLs! Choose from curated presets with 1-click auto-population:\n  - 🚀 **`nixpkgs-unstable`** (Rolling): Bleeding-edge packages updated multiple times daily.\n  - 🛡️ **`nixos-24.05`** (Stable): Production stable release with highest stability.\n  - ⚡ **`nixos-unstable`** (Rolling): Full rolling NixOS channel.\n  - 🏠 **`home-manager`** (Community): Declarative user dotfiles and environment manager.\n  - 🦀 **`rust-overlay`** (Overlay): Up-to-date Rust toolchains and nightly WASM builds.\n  - 🧪 **`nixos-hardware`** (Hardware): Hardware-specific configurations and drivers.\n\n#### 2. 🟢 Channel Health & Ping Latency Probe\n- Table columns now dynamically test reachability and display upstream ping latency in milliseconds (e.g. `🟢 Online (120ms)`).\n\n#### 3. 🔄 Targeted Single-Channel Updates & Rollback\n- Added **'🔄 Update Selected'** button to pull revisions for just one channel without waiting for the rest.\n- Added **'⏪ Rollback'** button to revert channels to their previous generation instantly.\n\n#### 4. 📡 Embedded Live Download Terminal\n- In-tab mini terminal displays live downloading, unpacking, and evaluating progress during channel updates.\n\n#### 5. 🧪 100% Comprehensive Test Suite\n- Added `tests/test_channels.py` (24/24 unit tests passing)."
  },
