    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/zipball/v1.6.0",
    "body": "### 🚀 What's New in v1.6.0\n\nThis release marks the biggest upgrade yet, delivering the complete WingetUI parity suite:\n\n#### 1. 🔄 Dedicated Updates Center (`UpdatesView`)\n- Unified updates discovery across **Nixpkgs channels**, **Snap**, and **Flatpak**.\n- Rich table with package name, installed version, available update version, and manager badge.\n- Instant batch control buttons: **'⚡ Check for Updates'**, **'🚀 Upgrade Selected'**, and **'✨ Upgrade All'**.\n\n#### 2. 💾 1-Click Backup & Restore Software Stack (`nixmanager-stack.json`)\n- **'💾 Export Stack'**: Exports all detected software from all package managers into a structured JSON manifest or reproducible `shell.nix`.\n- **'📥 Restore Stack'**: Restores and provisions all software applications on a freshly installed system with a single click.\n\n#### 3. 🖼️ Rich App Details Modal (`AppDetailsDialog`)\n- Double-clicking any application row in Discover or Installed tabs opens a modern details card.\n- Displays high-resolution icon, category badge, manager source badge, license, and clickable official homepage link.\n\n#### 4. 🌐 Live Online Repository Search API (`OnlineSearchService`)\n- Added **'🌐 Live Online Search'** connecting to the Flathub public REST API.\n- Search over 100,000+ Linux packages on the fly with real-time streaming to the console terminal and 1-click installation.\n\n#### 5. 🧪 100% Test Suite Coverage\n- Added automated tests across all 4 components (20/20 tests passing cleanly)."
