    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/zipball/v1.5.0",
    "body": "### 🚀 What's New in v1.5.0\n\n#### 1. 🗑 Standard Uninstall vs 💥 Deep Purge (المسح العادي والمسح النهائي الشامل)\nUsers now have full control over how software is removed from the system:\n- **Standard Uninstall (مسح عادي):** Removes the package executable and registrations while preserving your user configuration and cache.\n- **Deep Purge (مسح نهائي شامل):** Eradicates the package completely as if it was never installed before:\n  - **Nix:** Removes profile symlinks, wipes `~/.config/<pkg>`, `~/.cache/<pkg>`, `~/.local/share/<pkg>`, cleans up desktop launchers, and triggers deep store garbage collection (`nix-collect-garbage -d`).\n  - **Snap:** Runs `snap remove --purge <pkg>` and wipes user data in `~/snap/<pkg>`.\n  - **Flatpak:** Runs `flatpak uninstall --delete-data -y <app_id>` and wipes sandbox directories in `~/.var/app/<app_id>`.\n\n#### 2. 🛡 Safety Confirmation Modal & Context Menus\n- Added visual '🗑 Uninstall' and specialized red '💥 Deep Purge' buttons to the toolbar.\n- Added both operations to the right-click context menu.\n- Added explicit confirmation prompt with warning before any irreversible purge occurs.\n\n#### 3. 🧪 Full Test Suite Coverage\n- Added automated unit test suite for all standard and deep purge scenarios across package managers (14/14 tests passing)."
  },
