    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/zipball/v1.4.0",
    "body": "## 🚀 What's New in v1.4.0 (Universal Linux Package Manager)\n\n### 📦 Universal Multi-Manager Discovery\n- **All Installed Software in One Place:** Discovers and displays packages across **Nix**, **Snap**, and **Flatpak** automatically!\n- **Manager / Source Column:** Treeview clearly labels each app with its provider: `❄️ Nix`, `📦 Snap`, and `🚀 Flatpak`.\n- **Source Filter Selector:** Switch between `All Sources`, `Nix ❄️`, `Snap 📦`, and `Flatpak 🚀` instantly.\n- **Instant Search Bar:** Filter all installed apps across your entire system in real-time as you type.\n- **Universal Uninstaller:** Automatically invokes the correct manager command (`nix-env -e`, `snap remove`, or `flatpak uninstall`) depending on the selected package.\n\n### 🛡️ Desktop & Shell Auto-Integration (No More Broken Packages)\n- **Automatic Environment Injection:** Auto-injects Nix binary paths into child processes and resolves paths via `shutil.which` — eliminating `nix-env not found` errors forever.\n- **Auto-Configured `~/.bashrc`:** Automatically appends Nix PATH and XDG_DATA_DIRS configuration so all installed packages work immediately in any terminal.\n- **Ubuntu Dash Shortcut Sync:** Auto-detects and synchronizes `.desktop` entries for GUI applications installed via Nix into `~/.local/share/applications`."
  },
