    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/tarball/v1.3.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/NixManagerPro/zipball/v1.3.0",
    "body": "## 🚀 What's New in v1.3.0 (WingetUI / UniGetUI Experience)\n\n### 🛍️ Discover Software Center\n- **Instant App Store Catalog:** 40+ curated top-tier developer and desktop software (VS Code, Neovim, Firefox, Git, Docker, Go, Python, Rust, Node.js, VLC, etc.) ready to browse with **0ms latency**.\n- **Visual Category Filter Pills:** Switch effortlessly between `All`, `Development`, `Internet`, `System & Shell`, `Runtimes`, `Media`, and `Utilities`.\n- **WingetUI Package Details Drawer:** Select any package to see its full description, category badge, license, direct `🌐 Homepage` opener button, `📋 Copy Command` button, and `⬇ Install Package` action.\n\n### 🧭 Modern Left Sidebar Navigation\n- Sleek WingetUI vertical sidebar navigation replacing traditional notebook tabs.\n- Smooth view switching between:\n  - 🔍 **Discover Software** (WingetUI Store)\n  - 📦 **Installed Packages** (Installed apps, batch removal, shell.nix exporter)\n  - 🔄 **Updates & Health** (Live daemon diagnostics & 1-click upgrade)\n  - ⏱️ **Generations & Rollback** (Atomic snapshot history & rollback)\n  - 📡 **Nix Channels** (Upstream subscriptions & updater)\n  - 🖥️ **Live Console Stream** (Real-time terminal pipe output)\n- Persistent bottom status monitor: `🟢 System Ready | Nix Daemon Active`.\n\n### 🛡️ Bulletproof Desktop Launcher\n- Auto-generated launcher at `~/.local/bin/nixmanager` handling paths with spaces or special characters seamlessly.\n- Ubuntu App Grid integration via `~/.local/share/applications/nixmanager.desktop`."
  },
