    "body": "## What's Changed in v1.2.1\n\n### 🛠️ Usability & Fixes\n- **Instant Curated Catalog (0ms Latency)**: Added in-memory catalog of 30+ top developer tools, runtimes, media and utilities (Git, Neovim, Htop, Ripgrep, Node.js, Python, FFmpeg, etc.) so users can discover and install software immediately without waiting for slow Nixpkgs evaluation (#23).\n- **Embedded In-Tab Live Terminal**: Added a live progress monitor directly inside the Install tab so you can watch download/build progress in real time without switching tabs.\n- **Fixed Ubuntu Launcher**: Generated a dedicated `~/.local/bin/nixmanager` wrapper to prevent directory space/quote issues from breaking the `.desktop` shortcut in the Ubuntu Application grid."
